{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "65075866-40f7-8267-a659-13197942fe99",
  "created_at": "2026-03-04T12:36:16-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Lucia Vieira",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T12:33:49-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T12:33:52-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi Kevin, it's Lucia Vieira. I'm on speaker because I've got my hands full, so if I sound like I'm at the bottom of a well, that's just me and my kitchen."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T12:34:05-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem, I can hear you fine. What can I do for you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T12:34:11-05:00",
      "duration": 21,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, I'm a renter, and my landlord cleaned out the downstairs unit after the tenants moved out. He put the whole pile on the curb. A mattress, a couch, a couple of broken chairs, some bags of who knows what. [pause] Sorry, hang on, I'm getting my boots on by the door."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T12:34:32-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Take your time."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T12:34:34-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. [pause] Ugh. There. Anyway, it's been sitting there since Monday and I don't think the regular trash guys are going to take it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T12:34:44-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, bulk items usually need to be arranged ahead of time, they don't go with the regular pickup. What's the address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T12:34:53-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's 182 Broadway, up in the North End."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T12:34:57-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "One eighty-two Broadway. Got it. And you said the landlord put it out, not you, right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T12:35:04-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, not me. I just have to look at it. Believe me, I'd have put it somewhere less charming."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T12:35:12-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. So I'm writing this down: bulk waste at the curb, mattress, couch, chairs, bags, left after a move-out, reported by the tenant. Do you know if the landlord scheduled anything with us?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T12:35:26-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I have no idea. He doesn't tell me anything. That's partly why I'm calling. I'd like a supervisor to call me back about it, if that's possible. I want to know what happens with it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T12:35:40-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, I can put in a request for a supervisor to call you. Best number?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T12:35:47-05:00",
      "duration": 1,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0195."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T12:35:48-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-nine-five. Is that a cell?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T12:35:52-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, it's my cell. I'll have it with me."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T12:35:57-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. I'll note it's the tenant calling and that the pile has been out since Monday. Somebody should get back to you, probably today or tomorrow."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T12:36:08-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine. Thank you, Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T12:36:11-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome. Have a good afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T12:36:14-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too. Bye."
    }
  ],
